.TH "SERVICEWORKER.SCRIPTURL" "3JS" "September 29, 2026" "JavaScript" "JavaScript Reference Manual"
.SH NAME
ServiceWorker.scriptURL \- ServiceWorker: scriptURL property
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Secure context:\f[R] This feature is available only in secure
contexts (HTTPS).
.PP
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]scriptURL\f[B]\f[R] read\-only property of the
\f[CR]ServiceWorker\f[R] interface returns the \f[CR]ServiceWorker\f[R]
serialized script URL defined as part of
\f[CR]ServiceWorkerRegistration\f[R].
Must be on the same origin as the document that registers the
\f[CR]ServiceWorker\f[R].
.SH VALUE
A string.
.SH EXAMPLES
.IP
.EX
\f[B]const\f[R] sw = navigator.serviceWorker.controller;
console.log(sw.scriptURL);
\f[I]// https://example.com/scripts/service\-worker.js\f[R]
.EE
